Package: shinytabs
Title: Dynamic Tabsets for 'shiny' Apps
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Colin", "Rundel", , "rundel@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A 'shiny' module for tabsets whose tabs are created and closed by
    the user at run time. Each tab hosts an instance of a module chosen from a
    configurable set of tab types; tabs can be added from a menu, closed with
    an optional confirmation, reordered by dragging and renamed in place. The
    tab list, selection and titles are also controllable from the server.
